// Dialog :
"P871167127" "The Clockwork King? I haven't thought about him in the longest time. I guess I always heard that he had truly phenomenal psychic powers, that he could do remarkable things if he weren't limited by his insanity. It sounds like that other dimension fell totally under his dominion. You say there were no people at all? {HeroName}, I wonder what happened. I wonder how long the King can survive there all by himself? With his fantastic psychic powers sustaining his brain, I guess he could spend the next millennium roaming that barren rock alone."
// RandomFameString :
"P2371558556" "Did I hear this right? {HeroName} has been fighting the Clockwork?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Portal_Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P631219032" "This is a first, {HeroName}. A freedom fighter from another world just contacted us and asked for help. Apparently, her world is under the brutal control of its version of Nemesis. Anyway, this freedom fighter, Julianne Thompson, says that a bunch of her comrades in the resistance are about to be rounded up. There aren't any more heroes on our world, so she knew she had to look elsewhere. It sounds like a worthy cause to me. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Go rescue those freedom fighters.</A> <color orange>You only have 2 hours.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P4033015468" "Rescue the freedom fighters"
// SendOffString :
"P1362915765" "Any world under the control of Nemesis can use all the help we can lend them."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1367625021" "I told Julianne Thompson we'd rescue her comrades!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P645894970" "Nemesis' world looks a lot like ours, but the streets are somehow unwelcoming."

