// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P154235711" "You're saying that one of those freedom fighters you rescued was me? I mean, an alternate version of me? No matter how many times I hear that around here, I never get used to it. Anyway, I got a message from Julianne Thompson, the leader of the freedom fighters. She says that all of her people are safe now, in a secure location. You just struck a blow against Nemesis, {HeroName}. Albeit a different Nemesis than our own."
// RandomFameString :
"P1414357150" "{HeroName}'s been seen quite a bit on Peregrine Island lately. Why do you suppose that is?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P910670871" "I got a message from Julianne Thompson, the leader of the resistance on that world ruled by Nemesis. She thanks you for your efforts, and she'll continue trying to free the freedom fighters Nemesis managed to capture. I know you did your best, {HeroName}, so don't get too down. We'll keep an eye on the situation there."
// RandomFameString :
"P24504816" "I hear {HeroName}'s in the doghouse over at Portal Corporation."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Portal_Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P393003604" "{HeroName}, I just got word of a major security breach over on Peregrine Island. It seems the Council has broken through a portal, and they're trying to gather recruits from a world where the Council is in total control. If that happens, we could be overrun with agents in no time flat. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to get over to Peregrine and stop those Council soldiers!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2742799507" "Stop the Council soldiers"
// SendOffString :
"P2235687501" "The dimension you'll be going to is designated Omega Omicron 26-20, but most people just call it the Council Empire."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1697198904" "Defeat all negotiators in area"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1734603764" "The Council is still trying to recruit new soldiers from the Council Empire!"

