// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Rosetta 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2228555413" "Pink plasma"
// DetailString :
"P2613957612" "Dr. Steven Sheridan engineered this plasma from the gelatinous substance the Hydra Men use to communicate with one another. After some time in the Hydra Men's world, you should begin to understand their thoughts."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Gunk 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P418386505" "Aue"io's story"
// DetailString :
"P27960545" "When you defeated the Man O' War, Aue"io, you heard his voice inside your head: <br><br>'For years, you invaders have plagued us. First, the Rikti. They kidnapped our people and took them to some strange world. Now, you. I do not know your purpose, stranger, but you would do best to leave us in peace.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2507519504" "There's good news, {HeroName}. After months of effort, some Portal Corporation techs have managed to isolate the dimension the Hydra comes from. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>We want you to go there and learn anything you can about the Hydra.</A> Thanks to the efforts of Paragon City's brave heroes, the monster is relatively contained within the sewer system. But it has enormous regenerative powers, and we need to find a way to defeat it for good. If you find anything, take it to Dr. Steve Sheridan.  He knows a lot about extra-dimensional species."
// AcceptString :
"P2860537449" "Go to the Hydra's dimension and learn anything you can"
// SendOffString :
"P467881150" "I'm not really sure what you'll find there. From our initial probes, it looks like a pretty scary place."
// TaskTitle :
"P3813891818" "The Hydra Dimension"

