"P3573511738" "Don't feel too bad, {HeroName}. It sounds as though your alternate self wiped out that dimension, but that doesn't mean you're responsible. If anything, you should take it as a warning. I guess your other self was corrupted by your terrific power. Remember that, and don't let it happen to you!"
