// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P435396655" "{HeroName}, we're tracking a strange signal from another dimension. Ninety percent of the time these things turn out to be some other dimension's version of satellite TV. Still, it's got the guys over in Risk Management all atwitter. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>They asked if I'd send you to check out this strange signal.</A> Scout out the area, determine the signal's source, and report back."
// AcceptString :
"P1546427495" "Check out the strange signal"
// SendOffString :
"P2618780107" "You'll be going to dimension Upsilon Beta 9-6. Not much is known about it yet."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2547690361" "Defeat Anti-Matter & his men"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3979218955" "What's going on with that signal from Upsilon Beta 9-6?"

