// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - RebelStory 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2618539857" "The captive's story"
// DetailString :
"P1688759383" "One of the rebels you rescued from the Banished Pantheon's world told you: <br><br>'Our gods live on pain and fear. Some of their favorite dishes, like myself and my companions, they have enchanted with everlasting life. They keep us alive for century after century, feasting on our misery. After I return with you to your world, I won't be immortal anymore. That doesn't matter. I only want to be free.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3781425125" "Are you familiar with the Banished Pantheon, the evil cult that overran the cemetery in Dark Astoria? Well, they're not just a problem for our world. I've been in contact with a world in which the gods that make up the Pantheon were never banished to the spirit world. Instead, they became the dominant gods on their planet and wreaked havoc for millennia! The resistance on that planet have asked for a favor. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>They've asked us to extract a group of captives held by the Pantheon.</A> Will you do it, {HeroName}? <color orange>You only have 90 minutes to save the captives.  And be warned: these captives are being held by a powerful creature called 'Adamastor'.  From what little we know, you will almost certainly need help from other heroes to have a chance against it.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P3503941670" "Extract the rebels from the Pantheon's dimension"
// SendOffString :
"P3703464439" "The Pantheon's gods are a brutal, bloodthirsty lot. I'd hate to find out what horrors they could dream up after millennia of free reign."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2239090580" "Defeat Adamastor & its servants"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P792448589" "You need to extract those rebels from the Pantheon's dimension!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1250472765" "You hear a thunderous footstep. A pause, then you hear another."

