// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1409105484" "We will have an entire world under our control!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4087185955" "You will not stop our conquest!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - CoT1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3539590147" "Captive Oranbegan"
// Description :
"P253891913" "mages to save"
// SingularDescription :
"P1785494455" "save the last mage!"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P130933208" "I could not bear to raise my fists against them!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - CoT2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P4255262717" "They wanted us all to be their slaves!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Cot3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2545122530" "They thought they could control us!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Cot4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1183839507" "What is wrong with your world? Why is it so violent?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Cot5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P46113041" "Violence is abhorrent to us!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Cot6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3019740532" "We cannot serve these people! They are demented!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Cot7 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P4282118528" "With you around, perhaps there is hope that your world may one day evolve as ours has."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Cot8 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P135681048" "Even your world's heroes use violence to solve problems. How can this be?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Cot9 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3663082558" "Your world is lucky to have you!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Cot10 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1792139754" "{Rescuer}? Is that your name? A strange one, but I'll remember it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Cot11 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2233657450" "You have done Oranbega a great service. I salute you, strange one."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Cot12 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2365161604" "Our gratitude will always be with you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3643636523" "You saved the Oranbegans from the Malta Group."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3657753654" "The Malta Group has taken some of the Oranbegans into custody."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1493482838" "A world on which the Circle of Thorns turned into utter pacifists? I guess I've heard stranger things. You did a good thing by protecting them against the Malta Group, {HeroName}. Portal Corporation is working on a method for locking the Malta Group out of other dimensions. Until it's ready, we'll just have to rely upon your skillful assistance."
// RandomFameString :
"P756895648" "{HeroName} was saying that the Oranbegans aren't all bad. Oranbegans? Aren't those the Circle?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P95191199" "You tried, {HeroName}, I know you tried. I'll get word to Crimson and Indigo, the people handling the Malta threat. They'll try to extract the Oranbegans from Malta custody. Don't worry; they're professionals. They know how to handle things like this."
// RandomFameString :
"P3132743794" "{HeroName}'s been in and out of those alternate dimensions, but Portal Corporation doesn't seem too happy with the results."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Portal_Mission10 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - RANDOM_FEMALE_MEDICAL 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - VivStory 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1181377261" "Vivian van Dyne's story"
// DetailString :
"P3695495045" "When you rescued Dr. van Dyne, she told you: <br><br>'They wanted me to make drugs for them. Here on this world, the Freakshow managed to wipe out a large part of Paragon City's infrastructure. For a while they were happy with the chaos, but they hadn't realized the cost. Without any drug companies or hospitals, they had no easy way to manufacture Excelsior. Their implants began to hurt them terribly. I have to admit, I feel bad for them. I know they kidnapped me, but they're suffering! Isn't there anything we can do?'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3976687982" "We just got an emergency call. Vivian van Dyne, a world class scientist, has just been kidnapped. Our technology indicates that she's been taken to another dimension, and we've managed to pinpoint the correct one: Omicron Zeta 12-20. Portal Corporation's techs discovered the dimension just last week; it was a chunk of broken rubble, ruled over by a clan of Freakshow. Perhaps our investigation into their territory provoked this attack. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I don't know if the Freaks on that world are as nasty as the ones here, but I need you to rescue Vivian van Dyne.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1636779187" "Rescue Vivian van Dyne"
// SendOffString :
"P2377818301" "Dr. van Dyne's employers tell me she was hard at work on a new anesthetic drug. Perhaps her kidnapping has something to do with that."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3434309266" "I don't want to see you again without Dr. van Dyne in tow."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3006691904" "A heavy techno beat blasts across the still waters of this ruined wasteland."

