// ModelDisplayName :
"P2463289698" "Dr. Vivian van Dyne"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2018784584" "Thank you, {Rescuer}! This has been quite an ordeal!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3133361390" "You rescued Vivian van Dyne."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1180483827" "The Freakshow of Omicron Zeta 12-20 sure made a mess for themselves. I suppose in a way I do feel bad for them. I can't let them kidnap our scientists, but I can arrange for a shipment of analgesic drugs to be sent to their dimension. Nothing dangerous like the Excelsior the Freaks use to enhance their strength, of course. Just something to keep their implants from paining them so greatly."
// RandomFameString :
"P2883839351" "{HeroName} rescued my friend, Vivian van Dyne!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Portal_Errand1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2775548896" "Portal Corporation's been having a big problem maintaining safety for the lab on Peregrine Island. One of the worst offenders is the Rikti. They seem determined to steal our technology, destroy it, or possibly both! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like you to head over to Peregrine Island and clear the Rikti out.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3173847881" "Go to Peregrine Island and clear the Rikti out"
// SendOffString :
"P4184925715" "The Rikti have never seen any technology they didn't want to control. Be wary of them, {HeroName}. If I were you, I'd start my search in Nelson Borough or Curry Cove."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4102077529" "Defend Peregrine from Rikti"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1364968732" "Those Rikti are still causing a big problem over on Peregrine Island."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P748794343" "You have discouraged the Rikti from attacking Portal Corporation."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P171939137" "The security officers over at Portal Corporation are reporting a significant decrease in Rikti activity. Apparently, you really showed them what's what."
// RandomFameString :
"P261159540" "{HeroName} won't stand for Rikti mucking around on Peregrine Island."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Portal_Errand2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Disk 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P354772511" "Disk"
// DetailString :
"P1860848986" "One of the Crey agents you defeated gave you this disk, labeled 'Project Other Self.' According to the agent, it contains data on Crey's progress in their efforts to reach alternate dimensions. You can only hope it'll be enough to help Portal Corporation."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2314039005" "We're a little worried about Crey lately. It seems they've been making attempts to access other dimensions, with some degree of success. I can't stress this enough, {HeroName}: dimensional stability is not something to be toyed with! We need you to hit the streets and see what you can learn about Crey's efforts. If we can learn about their technology, we may be able to block them from accessing other worlds."
// AcceptString :
"P2811805711" "See what you can learn about Crey's efforts"
// SendOffString :
"P1845093538" "Crey may be the most power-hungry organization I've ever seen. And, as you might imagine, {HeroName}, I've seen a lot. I hear you can find Crey in the Rikti War Zone, and occasionally right here on Peregrine."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2810470340" "Interrogate Crey agents"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3469729550" "We need to know what progress Crey has made in their efforts to access other worlds."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P778134418" "Eliminate {HeroName} once and for all!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3324043175" "One of the Crey agents gave up a disk containing information on Crey's efforts to access other dimensions."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1585204708" "This disk should be a big help, {HeroName}. Thank you so much! I have to admit, Crey is an organization that really frightens me. I simply don't think they have any idea of how dangerous portal technology can be. Why, by mucking around in other dimensions they could be... Well, perhaps that's better left unsaid."
// RandomFameString :
"P2560564216" "I saw {HeroName} go to town on those Crey goons earlier."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_Portal_Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P170106147" "Peregrine Island may house some of the most important technology on this planet, {HeroName}. And it looks like the Malta Group knows it. They've been hanging around the area, trying to get their mitts on any information they can. Some of our technicians have even been assaulted! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to protect Peregrine Island from the Malta Group.</A> A lot is at stake here, {HeroName}; more than you realize."
// AcceptString :
"P1929855568" "Protect Peregrine Island from the Malta Group"
// SendOffString :
"P2229105699" "The Malta Group has shown a lot of persistence in this matter. They won't be deterred easily. Look for them near Bayside Docks or Curry Cove."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1669264743" "Defend Peregrine from Malta"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3849616378" "According to my sources, the Malta espionage on Peregrine Island is still as bad as ever."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P440133833" "Execute attack pattern Tango."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P38138841" "You discouraged the Malta Group from spying on Portal Corporation."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3504517212" "I'll sleep a lot better knowing you've got your eye on the Malta Group's activities. If they were ever to get their hands on Portal Corporation's technology, they'd become a great deal more dangerous overnight."
// RandomFameString :
"P2299217009" "The Malta Group better not set foot on Peregrine Island while {HeroName}'s around!"
